# Gemini API key for the in-park tour guide.
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey then copy this file to .env:
#   cp .env.example .env
# and paste your key below. The app runs fine without it — the guide panel
# will simply show instructions instead of answering.
#
# NOTE: with a key in .env the key is embedded in the client bundle. That is
# fine for personal/local use. If you ever deploy this publicly, move the
# Gemini call behind a small server-side proxy instead.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
